{
  "_about": "From Prompt to Private, Part 10: the end-to-end exam. Fifty questions written against the five documents under knowledge/. Every phrase in a 'must' list is text that actually appears in those documents. 'must'/'must_any'/'must_not' are matched case-insensitively as substrings of the answer the user would have seen (after the citation guard). grounded-staff questions are run twice: as staff (the 'must' lists apply) and as public (the exact refusal is the only pass). Clinic, people and partners are fictional.",
